  "note": "Transcript: \"they want to cut a deal with you and they want to see if you want to do a plea bargain\" - the lawyer relays an offer; he does not urge a deal, and \"they\" (not explicitly police) claim the prints.",
  "fix": {
   "label": "Camino Says His Lawyer Relayed Footprint and Palm Print Evidence and a Plea Offer",
   "claim": "In the played clip, Camino says his lawyer told him they said they had footprints and a palm print of his lifted from a scene and wanted to see if he would take a plea bargain before a pre-trial hearing, and that a jury then returned a guilty verdict."
  }
 },
